     ```bash                                                                    
     conda activate piggpa                                                      
     bash                                                                       
     /workspace/pigbole/.piggpa/skills/piggpa-G/genotype-import/scripts/gen     
     o-import.sh \                                                              
       --genotype_format bgen \                                                 
       --genotype_file <your_bgen_prefix> \                                     
       [--sample_file <sample_file>] \                                          
       [--output_prefix <name>] \                                               
       [--outdir <output_dir>] \                                                
       [--threads <N>]                                                          
     ```                                                                        
                                                                                
     **Parameters:**                                                            
     - `--genotype_file` — prefix path **without** `.bgen` extension. If        
     your file is `/data/my_cohort.bgen`, pass just `/data/my_cohort`           
     - `--sample_file` — optional. Defaults to `<prefix>.sample` if not         
     provided                                                                   
     - `--output_prefix` — defaults to `geno_import`. Produces                  
     `.bed/.bim/.fam`                                                           
     - `--threads` — defaults to `4`                                            
                                                                                
     **Output:** PLINK binary triplet — `{outprefix}.bed`,                      
     `{outprefix}.bim`, `{outprefix}.fam`                                       
                                                                                
